    "text": "Rain, driven by the wind, falls on a railway compartment with a velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math> to the vertical. The train moves, along the direction of wind flow, at a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>108</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>hr</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The apparent velocity of rain for a person sitting in the train is"
